Migrations are explicit release commands, never application startup side effects.

uv run alembic upgrade head
uv run alembic check
uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Describe schema change"

Use APP_DATABASE_MIGRATION_URL (or DIRECT_DATABASE_URL) for a direct PostgreSQL
connection when APP_DATABASE_URL points at a transaction pooler. Import each new
model in migrations/env.py before generating its migration. Review generated SQL
on both SQLite and PostgreSQL; SQLite table alterations use Alembic batch mode.
Never point a Preview deployment or test suite at a production database.
